<% content_for :title, "Terms — #{app_name}" %>
<% content_for :unframed, "true" %>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl">Terms</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3d3832]">
    <p>A business may message only people who opted in to hear from it.</p>
    <p>Marketing messages must include a way to opt out. A person who sends STOP, or an equivalent word, is not sent further marketing messages until they opt back in.</p>
    <p>Use of WhatsApp must follow the WhatsApp Business policy. Accounts that breach Meta's policies can be suspended.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-8 text-sm"><%= link_to "Home", root_path %> · <%= link_to "Privacy", privacy_path %></p>
</div>
